      "target": "A **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** or **HERETIC ASTARTES MOUNTED** unit of yours (not a **DAMNED** unit).",
      "effect": "The unit can shoot even after making an [advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) that turn, for the rest of the turn. While the unit has inflicted fewer than 6 wounds with **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** this turn, **bolt pistols**, **boltguns** and **combi-bolters** of its models get that ability, for the rest of the turn."
